{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Player": 48,
    "「少女」": 57
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "603101",
      "subQuestName": "(test)隐藏$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60172001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60172001": {
            "id": "60172001",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#我和{M#荧}{F#哥哥}的…飞船…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172002"
            ]
          },
          "60172002": {
            "id": "60172002",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "好大一艘。的确只有月亮上才能藏下它。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172003"
            ]
          },
          "60172003": {
            "id": "60172003",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172004"
            ]
          },
          "60172004": {
            "id": "60172004",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "#没事的，{NICKNAME}。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172005"
            ]
          },
          "60172005": {
            "id": "60172005",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "…欸？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172006"
            ]
          },
          "60172006": {
            "id": "60172006",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "在「祈月之夜」那晚，我也曾像你一样。明明那扇门就在眼前，却迟迟不敢踏进去。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172007"
            ]
          },
          "60172007": {
            "id": "60172007",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "「孤独」意味着和自己不在场的人生一起生活。在遇见你们之前，我拥有的就是那种孤独。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172008"
            ]
          },
          "60172008": {
            "id": "60172008",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "但在那一晚，「孤独」却变成了抛下遇见你们之后的人生…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172009"
            ]
          },
          "60172009": {
            "id": "60172009",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "哥伦比娅…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172010"
            ]
          },
          "60172010": {
            "id": "60172010",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "#去吧，{NICKNAME}，去拾起你曾丢失的那部分人生。相信我，你不会失去任何东西。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172011"
            ]
          },
          "60172011": {
            "id": "60172011",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "看，提瓦特就在那里。朋友们就在那里。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172012"
            ]
          },
          "60172012": {
            "id": "60172012",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "…嗯。谢谢你，哥伦比娅。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172013"
            ]
          },
          "60172013": {
            "id": "60172013",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（……）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172014"
            ]
          },
          "60172014": {
            "id": "60172014",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "♪~♪~",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172015"
            ]
          },
          "60172015": {
            "id": "60172015",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172016"
            ]
          },
          "60172016": {
            "id": "60172016",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "…嗯？看好了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172017"
            ]
          },
          "60172017": {
            "id": "60172017",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "嗯。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172018"
            ]
          },
          "60172018": {
            "id": "60172018",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "…你怎么把眼罩摘了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172019"
            ]
          },
          "60172019": {
            "id": "60172019",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "唔…回来后，我就想多看看这个世界了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172020"
            ]
          },
          "60172020": {
            "id": "60172020",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "以前不也好奇过，提瓦特在月亮上看会是什么样的吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172021"
            ]
          },
          "60172021": {
            "id": "60172021",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "觉得好看吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172022"
            ]
          },
          "60172022": {
            "id": "60172022",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "嗯，很美。感觉能在这里待一整天。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172023"
            ]
          },
          "60172023": {
            "id": "60172023",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "你呢？你的「真相」看起来如何？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172024"
            ]
          },
          "60172024": {
            "id": "60172024",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172025"
            ]
          },
          "60172025": {
            "id": "60172025",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我太久没看人们的表情了。但你的样子…好像觉得它不算好，但也不算坏？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172026"
            ]
          },
          "60172026": {
            "id": "60172026",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "哈…如果你一直睁着眼的话，说不定过一阵子就比奈芙尔还会察言观色了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172027"
            ]
          },
          "60172027": {
            "id": "60172027",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "唔…那还是不必了。我已经习惯了用月矩力去感知周围发生的事。「看」，就留给真正想留下回忆的时候吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172028"
            ]
          },
          "60172028": {
            "id": "60172028",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我…看了飞船留下的飞行日志。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172029"
            ]
          },
          "60172029": {
            "id": "60172029",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#我一直以为，自己是第一次到提瓦特…以为我和{M#荧}{F#哥哥}大概也就在太空中休眠了几百年…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172030"
            ]
          },
          "60172030": {
            "id": "60172030",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#但飞船记录却显示…我和{M#荧}{F#哥哥}的飞船在很久很久以前，就曾掠过提瓦特的上空了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172031"
            ]
          },
          "60172031": {
            "id": "60172031",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "掠过…？不是降落吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172032"
            ]
          },
          "60172032": {
            "id": "60172032",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "不，真的就像擦肩而过的掠过，几乎没作停留。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172033"
            ]
          },
          "60172033": {
            "id": "60172033",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "在那之后，飞船又在宇宙中飞行了很长时间。尽管飞船的数据有所损毁，但…经过的时间恐怕要以「千年」为计。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172034"
            ]
          },
          "60172034": {
            "id": "60172034",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "再之后，它就迫降到了挪德卡莱…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172035"
            ]
          },
          "60172035": {
            "id": "60172035",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172036"
            ]
          },
          "60172036": {
            "id": "60172036",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#（{M#荧}{F#哥哥}…是在飞船外找到的我…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172037"
            ]
          },
          "60172037": {
            "id": "60172037",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#（难道{M#她}{F#他}很久以前就离开了飞船吗？难道是我们掠过提瓦特的那一次吗…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172038"
            ]
          },
          "60172038": {
            "id": "60172038",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "你还好吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172039"
            ]
          },
          "60172039": {
            "id": "60172039",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "嗯…我感到事件的真相在一点点被拼凑起来。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172040"
            ]
          },
          "60172040": {
            "id": "60172040",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#我记得{M#荧}{F#哥哥}说，{M#她}{F#他}一开始在坎瑞亚的时候，回想不起过去的记忆…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172041"
            ]
          },
          "60172041": {
            "id": "60172041",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#说不定…这是连{M#她}{F#他}也不清楚的信息…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172042"
            ]
          },
          "60172042": {
            "id": "60172042",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "…来，给你留了个位置。这里很适合大量思考后发发呆，放松一下。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172043"
            ]
          },
          "60172043": {
            "id": "60172043",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "啊…！对了，还有一件事！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172044"
            ]
          },
          "60172044": {
            "id": "60172044",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "嗯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172045"
            ]
          },
          "60172045": {
            "id": "60172045",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "等我一下…！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172046"
            ]
          },
          "60172046": {
            "id": "60172046",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172047"
            ]
          },
          "60172047": {
            "id": "60172047",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "…哥伦比娅。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172048"
            ]
          },
          "60172048": {
            "id": "60172048",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "咦…？这是…你的新衣服吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172049"
            ]
          },
          "60172049": {
            "id": "60172049",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "…准确来说是旧衣服。它一直放在飞船的衣物柜中。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172050"
            ]
          },
          "60172050": {
            "id": "60172050",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#和{M#荧}{F#哥哥}穿的是一对，我记得{M#她}{F#他}以前就一直更喜欢这一套…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172051"
            ]
          },
          "60172051": {
            "id": "60172051",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "唔…在我看来没有很大区别。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172052"
            ]
          },
          "60172052": {
            "id": "60172052",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "是吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172053"
            ]
          },
          "60172053": {
            "id": "60172053",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "嗯，你就是你。不会因为换了套衣服就不一样了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172054"
            ]
          },
          "60172054": {
            "id": "60172054",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（哈哈…还真有她的风格…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172055"
            ]
          },
          "60172055": {
            "id": "60172055",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "#…{NICKNAME}，你觉得提瓦特对你来说是「家」吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172056"
            ]
          },
          "60172056": {
            "id": "60172056",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#（「家」…有{M#荧}{F#哥哥}的地方才是家…但在经历了这么多旅途后…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172057"
            ]
          },
          "60172057": {
            "id": "60172057",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "…我觉得是的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172058"
            ]
          },
          "60172058": {
            "id": "60172058",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "不会因为它换了一个面貌就不一样？我是说…假如以后它的「真相」和你想的不一样。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172059"
            ]
          },
          "60172059": {
            "id": "60172059",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "…我不知道，但我猜不会。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172060"
            ]
          },
          "60172060": {
            "id": "60172060",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "「真相」不是提瓦特对我来说最重要的东西。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172061"
            ]
          },
          "60172061": {
            "id": "60172061",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172062"
            ]
          },
          "60172062": {
            "id": "60172062",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "在我最初诞生在提瓦特的时候，我渴望「家」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172063"
            ]
          },
          "60172063": {
            "id": "60172063",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "当你在不懂事的时候得到了一样东西，你就会以为它该是那个样子。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172064"
            ]
          },
          "60172064": {
            "id": "60172064",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我以为「家」是「交换」。你给我我想要的，我还给你你想要的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172065"
            ]
          },
          "60172065": {
            "id": "60172065",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "但在遇见你们之后，你们教会了我「家」应该是什么样子。你们从不渴求什么，反倒一直在给予我什么。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172066"
            ]
          },
          "60172066": {
            "id": "60172066",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "哥伦比娅值得朋友们的付出。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172067"
            ]
          },
          "60172067": {
            "id": "60172067",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "哈哈…以前的我一直以为，自己诞生在挪德卡莱是个意外。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172068"
            ]
          },
          "60172068": {
            "id": "60172068",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "但我回到了过去后才明白，在故事的最初，是我自己选择了挪德卡莱，选择那里成为我未来的「家」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172069"
            ]
          },
          "60172069": {
            "id": "60172069",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "现在的我，很庆幸过去自己做出了这样的选择。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172070"
            ]
          },
          "60172070": {
            "id": "60172070",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我相信朋友们也这么想。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172071"
            ]
          },
          "60172071": {
            "id": "60172071",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "所以，现在的我也会再做一次同样的事。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172072"
            ]
          },
          "60172072": {
            "id": "60172072",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "同样的事？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172073"
            ]
          },
          "60172073": {
            "id": "60172073",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "嗯，恒月月髓我已经交给了菈乌玛，虹月的则交给了阿蕾奇诺。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172074"
            ]
          },
          "60172074": {
            "id": "60172074",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我会将自己的月矩力，重新还给挪德卡莱。让它继续庇护着这个我选择的「家」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172075"
            ]
          },
          "60172075": {
            "id": "60172075",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "欸…？那你的身体…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172076"
            ]
          },
          "60172076": {
            "id": "60172076",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "嗯…？哦，你是在担心我会消失吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172077"
            ]
          },
          "60172077": {
            "id": "60172077",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "哈哈…不会的。这次不会了。「霜月」已经进入虚假之天。我也已经成为了「三月女神」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60172078"
            ]
          },
          "60172078": {
            "id": "60172078",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我所还回去的，是挪德卡莱需要的一部分，也是我想为「家」付出的一部分。",
